{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, which of the following is the smallest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/5/c455c5d2514558fd94f6fef2f3c321bdd92b9f66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{6}{x} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{6}{x+1} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{6}{x-1} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{x}{6} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{x+1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"449\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in for every answer choice would give\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c21f0bb01d6cc1c955f390146b4da51ff7cda3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{6}{7} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{6}{8} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{6}{6} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{7}{6} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{8}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"349\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>From here, we can see that the smallest is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3dc846042e0b9934185e23c85bbd3acb573797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{6}{x+1}&lt;\\dfrac{6}{x}&lt;\\dfrac{6}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"156\" height=\"40\" /> (for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66db4e19b3be56d841f02880243f258ec5d1e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf79dcc9f7e907836617f14b7ccfef6bf159a6e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{x}{6}&lt;\\dfrac{x+1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, we just need to compare <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/e/8befb172b81927007ac465562a602f45c5274776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{6}{x+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"48\" height=\"40\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f17560d652e15966fd522d3fc319b9f77ae1bc69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{x}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"16\" height=\"34\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa608ff4fd7754c4ff82a2e8ac12c2fbf6ab80f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/207828397421c455456ca53f50f8c177357a9076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{7}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, respectively, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c84db051d5b44b278f526fd4dba3a983bbd16bc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{3}{4}&lt;\\dfrac{7}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" />. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acd2c07965337bdedae0345914c28a3a1fb9abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(B) \\dfrac{6}{x+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"88\" height=\"51\" />. \n</p><p>~By Leon0168\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME\" title=\"1998 AJHSME\">1998 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_P